Bind Npc 24204 Zone 1 for karus priest
Bind Npc 14204 Zone 2 for elmorad priest
Quest 310 "Judgment"
    Journal for karus "[Priest] Minerva will give it to you if you achieve 7 victories in the National Defence Combat (the upper reaches of the Kalluga Valley)."
    Journal for elmorad "[Priest] Minerva will give it to you if you achieve 7 victories in the National Defence Combat (the upper reaches of the Kalluga Valley)."
    Collect 7 of 900017000

Requires player level >= 61

Rewards
    Give 1 of 379066000

On available
    Say "You know who to see if you want to know more about Judgment, don't you?"
    Topic "All right, I'll swing by" goto close

On offer
    Say "Judgment, which priests can learn with the 2nd job change is a technique which employs powerful attack power."
    Topic "Tell me more..." do
        Show quest "You will first have to prove to me that you are capable enough to handle Judgment Scroll.  Win seven victories at National Defence Combat at the upper reaches of the kalluga valley and then bring me the Symbol of Vctory to me, and I will give you this scroll.\n\nThe border defending battle is held every day at 10 AM and 1, 3, 5 and 10 PM and 1 AM. And it is held additionally at 8 PM on Tuesday, Friday, Saturday and Sunday when there is no war. When the relevant time comes, the announcement for recruitment will be aired automatically so that application for participation can be made"

On in_progress
    Say "You will first have to prove to me that you are capable enough to handle Judgment Scroll.  Win seven victories at National Defence Combat at the upper reaches of the kalluga valley and then bring me the Symbol of Vctory to me, and I will give you this scroll."

On ready
    Say "Master, all the ingredients have been collected. Go to complete the Judgment Scroll."
    Topic "Confirm" goto close

On claimable
    Show quest "You are ready. Please wait.\n\nThis is the Judgment Scroll. As it is a dangerous technique, please use it to protect justice under the name of the gods."
